{"id":"b2b62c1bcece60ed","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-solovay-function.md","title":"Parameterized Solovay Recursion","display":"df-solovay-function — Parameterized Solovay Recursion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-solovay-function","aliases":["89-df-solovay-function"],"display":"df-solovay-function — Parameterized Solovay Recursion","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-finite]]","[[89-df-provability-predicate]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-solovay-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-solovay-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-solovay-function — Parameterized Solovay Recursion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,R)\">\\((W,R)\\)</span> 是有限 GL 框架，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_0\\in W\">\\(w_0\\in W\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:n\\to W\">\\(e:n\\to W\\)</span> 是指定双射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L:W\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(L:W\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是指定句族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是数值证明关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_e\">\\(\\prec_e\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e(i)\\prec_e e(j)\\Longleftrightarrow i&lt;j\">\\(e(i)\\prec_e e(j)\\Longleftrightarrow i&lt;j\\)</span> 定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma&amp;:\\mathbb N\\to W,\\qquad \\sigma(0)\\coloneqq w_0,\\\\\nC_a&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v\\in W\\mid\\sigma(a)Rv\\land\n(a,\\ulcorner\\neg L(v)\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\n\\sigma(a+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min_{\\prec_e}C_a,&amp;C_a\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\sigma(a),&amp;C_a=\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma&amp;:\\mathbb N\\to W,\\qquad \\sigma(0)\\coloneqq w_0,\\\\\nC_a&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v\\in W\\mid\\sigma(a)Rv\\land\n(a,\\ulcorner\\neg L(v)\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\n\\sigma(a+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min_{\\prec_e}C_a,&amp;C_a\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\sigma(a),&amp;C_a=\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 9 章，印刷页 124–127；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n有限有序候选集有唯一最小元，原始递归给出唯一总函数。该参数化递归本身不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(v)\">\\(L(v)\\)</span> 就是它的极限句；实现原书忠实性所需的自指相容构造另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76b37345e1a3ad95\" href=\"?note=76b37345e1a3ad95\" title=\"89-lem-solovay-self-reference\">89-lem-solovay-self-reference</a>。因此不把任意句族的此递归当作已完成的 Solovay 反解释。原跨书线性序原子定义的是非严格序，这里直接用有限枚举诱导严格序。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-solovay-self-reference","status":"resolved","id":"76b37345e1a3ad95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 9 章，印刷页 124–127；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n有限有序候选集有唯一最小元，原始递归给出唯一总函数。该参数化递归本身不要求 $L(v)$ 就是它的极限句；实现原书忠实性所需的自指相容构造另见 [[89-lem-solovay-self-reference]]。因此不把任意句族的此递归当作已完成的 Solovay 反解释。原跨书线性序原子定义的是非严格序，这里直接用有限枚举诱导严格序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"w_0\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"e:n\\to W","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"L:W\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_e","display":false},{"tex":"e(i)\\prec_e e(j)\\Longleftrightarrow i<j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma&:\\mathbb N\\to W,\\qquad \\sigma(0)\\coloneqq w_0,\\\\\nC_a&\\coloneqq\\{v\\in W\\mid\\sigma(a)Rv\\land\n(a,\\ulcorner\\neg L(v)\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\n\\sigma(a+1)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min_{\\prec_e}C_a,&C_a\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\sigma(a),&C_a=\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L(v)","display":false}],"bytes":1615,"backlinks":[{"id":"070cc23caeb65b77","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"76b37345e1a3ad95","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-364","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-solovay-function]]"}],"outgoing":["c6ab46cd662b1409","9cd755e57aea2c47","841985de31202f85","76b37345e1a3ad95"]}